# The TTS environment for the time check (hpc/tts.sbatch): its own venv on the cluster, never the
# project's (pyproject.toml and uv.lock stay as they are). chatterbox-tts is installed with --no-deps,
# because its gradio demo, Chinese and Japanese extras are not needed; these are its runtime imports, at
# its own pins. torch and torchaudio are the CUDA 12.4 builds from download.pytorch.org (the cluster reaches
# it fast, PyPI only throttled); the CUDA libraries and triton are the same files there as on PyPI.
